  "steps": [
    "Slice the zucchini into thick rounds and remove the centres with a bottle cap to make rings. Keep the centres for the dip.",
    "Toss the rings with the oil, cornstarch, breadcrumbs, Parmesan and seasonings.",
    "Bake on a lined tray at 200 °C for 20–25 minutes until golden and crisp, then sprinkle with more Parmesan.",
    "Dip: soften the zucchini centres in the oil, then blend with the yogurt, tahini, lemon juice, garlic, parsley and seasonings until creamy."
